{
    "background_story": "Iyla was a brilliant and resourceful adventurer, known for her expertise in wilderness survival. She spent years honing her skills in the harshest environments, from the scorching deserts to the frozen tundras. Iyla's trusty ferrocerium rod was her most prized possession, a tool she used to start fires in the most inhospitable conditions. With a few swift strikes, she could conjure a warm flame, providing comfort and sustenance to her companions. During an ill-fated expedition to the Arctic Circle, Iyla's ferrocerium rod proved to be a lifesaver when a sudden blizzard stranded her team. She used it to start a fire, keeping everyone warm until rescue arrived. Iyla's ingenuity and quick thinking, combined with her trusty ferrocerium rod, earned her the nickname 'Spark of Life' among her fellow adventurers.",
